claim.claim-text:
1. A roller brush assembly comprising a roller and a brush set on the roller;
the roller contains an interior cavity constituted by at least two barrel bodies;
each portion of the barrel body edge is serrated shaped, and the adjacent serrated- shaped portions of the batter body form a blade slot for positioning the serrated-shaped blade;
wherein, the blade edge is corresponding to the teeth on the serrated shaped edge;
wherein, a driver unit is installed in the interior cavity to make the blade move along the barrel axially to cut the wrapped in the tooth groove.
